# GT6 art: no placeholders

New blocks and items get textures from local
`gt6_referencable_port_code/gregtech6_w` (gitignored; search it, do not assume
it is absent). Copy into
`src/main/resources/assets/cruciblecraft/textures/**/gt6_import/` (or an
existing family such as `gt6_energy_art/`). Java/tick source of truth remains
`gt6_code/gregtech6`. Do not fetch GitHub.

Do not alias another CC texture (`multiblock_casing`, `pipe_filter_cover`,
`conveyor_cover`, copper/furnace cubes) as a stand-in. Destination files use
CrucibleCraft registry paths, never 1.7.10 `gt.meta.*` / numbered multiitem
names.

Record each copy in a small art manifest (`source` → `gt6_source` →
`destination`). Historical machine/multiitem art debt is out of scope until a
card owns it; do not expand that while another unique active is open.
